OL,3,GNEWSAParents' anger after second bid to
OL,4,Aclose school
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have spoken of their
OL,7,Ffrustrations as another consultation
OL,8,Fhas opened over a potential closure of
OL,9,Fa school.
OL,11,FNorth Tyneside Council agreed to start
OL,12,Fa consultation on plans to close
OL,13,FHazlewood Primary School in Wideopen
OL,14,Fafter bosses said there was no viable
OL,15,Fway to rebuild the site which was in
OL,16,Fneed of major repairs.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
