OL,3,GNEWSAParents' anger after second bid to
OL,4,Aclose school
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the meeting on Monday, one father
OL,7,Fsaid there was "no accountability"
OL,8,Fwhile a mother said "it was a
OL,9,Fcommunity, we're putting our foot
OL,10,Fdown", with another mother saying
OL,11,Fchildren would remember "primary school
OL,12,Fas years of consultation".
OL,14,FThe council said no decision had been
OL,15,Fmade to close the school, with the
OL,16,Fconsultation allowing everyone to share
OL,17,Ftheir views.
